<title>HUNGARY: Richter shr offering to be held May 27-30.</title>
<headline>Richter shr offering to be held May 27-30.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A domestic share offering of Hungarian pharmaceuticals company Richter will be held between May 27 and May 30, the Hungarian news agency MTI said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
